{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included in this demo, you will have multiple possible endings - so feel free to try different options and unlock them all !\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under His Eyes is a gritty, story-driven strategy game where you play a crime boss. Make game-changing decisions, manage your crew and income, send operatives on missions, seize districts, and eliminate rivals. Will you rise through subtlety, rule with fear, or fall to a small-time gang?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the introduction of the game, where you will face, over 3 days, hard decisions with real outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE HARD CHOICES WITH REAL IMPACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161410/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.poster.avif?t=1762807387\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161410/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.webm?t=1762807387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161410/extras/7613193582e37d96c0707f7b315ce47f.mp4?t=1762807387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes your path. Choose wisely to grow your empire or risk losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-changing conversation with multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to unlock the interrogation scene to get more information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your operatives on overnight missions</p></li></ul>","ba